  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.73 Non-transport unit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.73 “Non-transport unit” means a licensed unit with licensed providers but which does not have vehicles licensed for patient transportation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
